otocol ecosystem, with SKY as its core holding. Through staking and other on-chain activities, the Company seeks to generate protocol-level economic exposure while maintaining governance, risk management, and public-company discipline. The Company is headquartered in West Palm Beach, Florida. For more information, please visit www.stabledev.com.","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1389545/000143774926025172/ex_995199.htm","filed":"2026-07-31","source":"8-K"}}